# BPB Website — Supabase

## Env (`.env`)

Use these names (do not invent aliases in new code):

- `SUPABASE_PROJECT_URL`
- `SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY`
- `SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD`
- `SUPABASE_DB_URL`

Never commit real values. Never echo secrets in docs or chat dumps.

## Catalog vs user data

| Kind | Tables | Public write |
|---|---|---|
| Game catalog | `items`, `combinations`, `combination_ingredients` | No |
| User content | `builds`, `build_placements` | Auth later |
| Accounts | `profiles` | Owner only |

## Assets

- **DB columns** store paths/filenames only (e.g. `items.image`)
- **Item sprites** → Supabase Storage bucket (e.g. `item-sprites`)
- **Fonts / site CSS/JS** → repo (`assets/`, `js/`, `css/`)
- Shared tooltip frames/icons may use CDN for POC; prefer `assets/` or Storage when self-hosting

## Implementation habits

- Join placements/recipes to `items` — never copy `effect` / rarity / name into builds
- Map DB `snake_case` → frontend camelCase (`extra_types` → `extraTypes`) before tooltips
- Follow detail SQL in `docs/db/tables/*.md` when creating or changing schema
